			"notes": "## 🎮 Controls\n\n* `N` → New waypoint\n* `B` → Show waypoint labels\n* `Open Waypoint Manager` → Unbound by default\n\nYou can switch `B` between:\n\n* Toggle mode\n* Hold mode\n\n---\n\n## ⚙️ Features\n\n* Clean in-game waypoint manager\n* Works on servers as a client-side mod\n* Separate waypoints per world/server\n* Singleplayer worlds with the same name stay separate\n* Copy and paste waypoint share codes\n* Import skips exact duplicates automatically\n* Colored labels\n* Adjustable label size\n* Optional Y coordinate\n* Overworld ↔ Nether linking (`X/Z` scale ×8)\n* Teleport button (only when `/tp` or `/teleport` is available to you)\n* Chat feedback for actions like add, import, delete, and copy"
		}
